# What a run writes inside the package checkout (run_final.py --out holds everything else).
# The preflight requires harness/ scorer/ llm/ to stay clean: bytecode is ignored.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Lean environments, upstream clones and install logs (infra/closed_package/install_envs.sh; tens of GB): everything in envs/ but its
# README, which stays tracked (envs/README.md says why)
envs/*
!envs/README.md
.envs-download/
# the staged rows file (harness/final_rows.py stage), the shards' ladder records, compile-slot scratch, guard log
data/final/
probe/heldout/
probe/hbtool/.scratch/
probe/refhb/.scratch/
probe/runaway_guard.log
# session records when a set runs from this checkout
probe/runs/
harness/hwork/
# never: keys live outside the checkout (~/.config/vexorium/)
*.key
secrets*
